"ICHITAN Iced Tea Lemon Cold Brew Style,

114
08:16.110 --> 08:17.700
mellow, intense, full-flavored."

115
08:19.360 --> 08:20.520
Where's your character?

116
08:20.900 --> 08:21.760
How do you say it with that?

117
08:22.790 --> 08:23.680
I'll show you.

118
08:25.140 --> 08:25.740
Here.

119
08:27.210 --> 08:30.280
"ICHITAN Iced Tea Lemon Cold Brew Style,

120
08:30.300 --> 08:32.240
mellow, intense, full-flavored,

121
08:32.400 --> 08:35.159
sweet and sour, so bold that it hits the spot!"

122
08:37.340 --> 08:37.840
Uke!

123
08:40.429 --> 08:41.200
A bottom, for sure.

124
08:43.090 --> 08:44.100
I'm the top...

125
08:46.800 --> 08:48.360
Here, give it a try.

126
08:52.420 --> 08:55.380
ICHITAN Iced Tea Lemon Cold Brew Style,

127
08:55.410 --> 08:57.200
mellow, intense, full-flavored,

128
08:57.390 --> 08:59.760
sweet and sour, so bold that it hits the spot!

129
09:00.130 --> 09:00.840
Uke!

130
09:22.600 --> 09:23.600
So, is it refreshing?

131
09:24.570 --> 09:26.000
Mm, pretty good.

132
09:30.690 --> 09:32.320
Do you visit places like this often?

133
09:33.930 --> 09:34.720
No.

134
09:35.000 --> 09:37.160
Even though I grew up in Ayutthaya,

135
09:38.120 --> 09:39.880
I didn't hang out at a place like this.

136
09:40.380 --> 09:41.440
I only went to malls.

137
09:41.640 --> 09:42.140
What?

138
09:43.000 --> 09:43.720
What?

139
09:44.460 --> 09:45.780
Don't you get bored

140
09:45.800 --> 09:47.300
being surrounded by buildings and malls?

141
09:49.200 --> 09:50.720
Sure, I do get bored.

142
09:51.400 --> 09:52.900
But if you kept me company,

143
09:54.690 --> 09:55.590
I wouldn't be.

144
09:57.560 --> 09:58.560
So delusional.

145
09:58.900 --> 09:59.840
Do you like it, though?

146
10:02.920 --> 10:03.920
Well, yeah.

147
10:09.320 --> 10:10.080
Hey,

148
10:10.800 --> 10:12.040
wanna go to a cafe?

149
10:12.210 --> 10:13.140
I heard they have cute elephants

150
10:13.160 --> 10:14.570
and a painting activity, too.

151
10:14.730 --> 10:16.240
Please, please, please, please, please, please?

152
10:18.810 --> 10:20.040
If you're with me,

153
10:21.300 --> 10:22.400
I'll go anywhere.

154
10:33.840 --> 10:35.080
Are you gonna go that way

155
10:35.700 --> 10:36.850
or this way?

156
10:39.090 --> 10:40.040
That way!

157
10:40.500 --> 10:41.240
Over there!

158
10:43.280 --> 10:44.150
How does one...

159
10:44.170 --> 10:45.160
become so delusional?!

160
10:46.190 --> 10:47.080
Better run.

161
10:48.890 --> 10:50.380
So fucking delusional...

162
11:20.800 --> 11:21.400
Hey.

163
11:22.100 --> 11:22.720
Hm?

164
11:23.540 --> 11:24.960
Aren't you afraid people are gonna see?

165
11:29.060 --> 11:30.040
Honestly,

166
11:30.550 --> 11:31.220
I'm not viral enough

167
11:31.240 --> 11:32.760
for people to recognize me yet.

168
11:33.540 --> 11:35.020
What if someone does?

169
11:35.880 --> 11:36.880
Then we run.

170
11:37.070 --> 11:38.360
You go left,

171
11:39.020 --> 11:40.060
and I'll go right,

172
11:40.490 --> 11:41.320
okay?

173
11:42.600 --> 11:44.480
You're afraid, but you're just acting cool.

174
11:45.260 --> 11:45.900
So...

175
11:45.920 --> 11:47.360
even though I might seem famous on X,

176
11:47.870 --> 11:49.960
I'm just a newcomer in the entertainment industry.

177
11:51.950 --> 11:53.800
I never said you were famous.

178
11:54.010 --> 11:55.100
Fine, I'm not.

179
11:56.420 --> 11:57.640
Then, we can live our lives, can't we?

180
11:58.280 --> 11:59.640
Alright, alright.

181
12:00.290 --> 12:01.560
Are you hungry now?

182
12:01.990 --> 12:02.860
Starting to.

183
12:03.250 --> 12:04.640
Then, after we're done drawing,

184
12:05.060 --> 12:06.420
I'll take you to eat

185
12:06.440 --> 12:08.400
the best noodle soup in the galaxy.

186
12:10.240 --> 12:11.040
Alright.

187
12:14.720 --> 12:15.720
What are you drawing?

188
12:18.060 --> 12:18.840
An elephant.

189
12:19.190 --> 12:19.920
Isn't it cute?

190
12:23.230 --> 12:24.630
But you're even cuter.

191
12:29.340 --> 12:30.400
Just keep drawing!

192
12:46.520 --> 12:49.230
[Baan Tiew Shop]

193
12:49.250 --> 12:50.080
Here we are!

194
12:50.100 --> 12:52.960
The best noodle shop in the galaxy.

195
12:53.250 --> 12:54.320
It's my family's shop.

196
12:54.340 --> 12:55.080
Mm-hm...

197
12:57.130 --> 12:58.480
Dad! Mom!

198
12:59.860 --> 13:01.200
Whoa, Wan!

199
13:01.610 --> 13:03.000
- Hello. - Goodness, sweetie.

200
13:04.960 --> 13:06.040
I miss you...

201
13:07.720 --> 13:08.380
Took you long enough.

202
13:08.400 --> 13:09.820
Your mom's been missing you so bad,

203
13:09.840 --> 13:10.480
you know that?

204
13:11.760 --> 13:13.720
I've been busy with work lately.

205
13:13.740 --> 13:15.280
Hey, that's a good thing.

206
13:15.370 --> 13:16.720
Oh, and why didn't View come with?

207
13:17.080 --> 13:19.000
She's at an exam prep camp, Mom.

208
13:19.310 --> 13:20.440
Right...

209
13:23.870 --> 13:24.600
Hello.

210
13:26.280 --> 13:27.840
This... is Third,

211
13:28.040 --> 13:28.940
an actor friend of mine,

212
13:28.960 --> 13:30.720
the male lead in the series I'm acting in.

213
13:35.490 --> 13:36.440
Here, I'll take care of him.

214
13:36.590 --> 13:37.840
What's wrong with you?

215
13:37.910 --> 13:38.880
What?!

216
13:40.000 --> 13:40.950
Spit it.

217
13:41.150 --> 13:41.760
Spit it!

218
13:42.260 --> 13:43.760
- He's handsome. - There!

219
13:43.890 --> 13:45.600
He wouldn't have become a male lead otherwise.

220
13:45.900 --> 13:47.230
- Right, it's nice you came here together. - Right.

221
13:47.250 --> 13:48.260
Have you eaten, sweetie?

222
13:48.280 --> 13:49.720
- Not yet. - Take a seat,

223
13:49.890 --> 13:50.220
alright?

224
13:50.240 --> 13:51.140
- Write down whatever you wanna eat. - Okay.

225
13:51.160 --> 13:52.480
It's... It's Dad's treat.

226
13:52.500 --> 13:53.630
Yeah...

227
13:53.650 --> 13:54.400
Sure thing.

228
13:54.640 --> 13:56.180
- Come on. - You look even better in person.

229
13:56.200 --> 13:57.380
Has anyone told you that?

230
13:58.400 --> 13:59.720
- Thank you. - Alrighty.

231
14:03.870 --> 14:05.280
This is how my parents are.

232
14:05.700 --> 14:07.520
They're sweet. I can feel their warmth.

233
14:09.900 --> 14:11.360
Mm...

234
14:12.480 --> 14:13.480
Write it down for me.

235
14:13.510 --> 14:14.080
Sure.

236
14:14.420 --> 14:16.560
I'll have rice vermicelli noodle soup with beef,

237
14:16.880 --> 14:18.360
no meatballs,

238
14:18.390 --> 14:20.000
and extra beef and veggies.

239
14:20.120 --> 14:21.640
I remember you don't do spicy.

240
14:21.780 --> 14:22.400
Ooh...

241
14:22.520 --> 14:23.560
you paid attention?

242
14:25.420 --> 14:26.320
What?

243
14:28.830 --> 14:30.790
If you get a taste of our soup,

244
14:30.810 --> 14:31.760
take my word for it.

245
14:31.780 --> 14:33.320
You'll find it the best in the universe.

246
14:33.650 --> 14:35.760
You're gonna be hooked, I guarantee it.

247
14:36.020 --> 14:36.920
So...

248
14:37.420 --> 14:38.840
What about the best in the unicycle?

249
14:39.090 --> 14:40.040
Wanna snack on some wheels?

250
14:45.620 --> 14:46.420
It'll be a minute.

251
14:49.200 --> 14:51.080
Here, make sure you eat it all up.

252
14:52.980 --> 14:54.140
Is that sarcasm?

253
14:55.380 --> 14:57.800
If you don't finish it, I'll fine you.

254
14:59.180 --> 15:01.280
I can just help your parents sell it.

255
15:02.020 --> 15:03.960
Do you even know how to make noodle soup?

256
15:10.980 --> 15:12.390
I'm an incredibly fast learner.

257
15:15.360 --> 15:17.120
Right... smarty-pants.

258
15:23.710 --> 15:25.090
Mm!

259
15:25.680 --> 15:27.240
How I miss this flavor!

260
15:28.570 --> 15:29.400
Wan!

261
15:29.640 --> 15:31.140
Eat your veggies, too, sweetie.

262
15:32.790 --> 15:34.100
Yes, Mom!

263
15:36.330 --> 15:37.220
You don't do veggies?

264
15:38.350 --> 15:39.080
Mm,

265
15:39.560 --> 15:40.760
I don't like them.

266
15:41.730 --> 15:42.560
You're such a baby.

267
15:43.000 --> 15:44.470
I saw you pick it out last time, too.

268
15:45.430 --> 15:46.360
I'm just a boy, aren't I?

269
15:48.710 --> 15:50.390
Pick out the veggies all you want,

270
15:51.210 --> 15:53.040
just don't pick my heart out.

271
15:58.870 --> 15:59.560
Ugh...

272
15:59.580 --> 16:00.480
What's the matter with you?

273
16:00.840 --> 16:02.640
If you're not gonna eat them, give them to me.

274
16:02.920 --> 16:03.640
That's all it takes.

275
16:12.500 --> 16:13.320
Is it good?

276
16:14.160 --> 16:15.840
Mm, it is good.

277
16:16.220 --> 16:17.320
Told ya.

278
16:17.480 --> 16:19.440
This is an Ayutthaya delight!

279
16:21.080 --> 16:22.000
Just like you?

280
16:22.660 --> 16:24.160
Ayutthaya's delight.

281
16:26.850 --> 16:27.680
You freaking Third...

282
16:28.650 --> 16:29.410
Hey,

283
16:29.930 --> 16:31.350
how dare you call me "you freaking Third"?

284
16:31.770 --> 16:32.640
I'm older than you.

285
16:35.580 --> 16:37.080
Call me "Third, big guy," would you?

286
16:37.330 --> 16:38.760
"Third, big guy..."

287
16:38.960 --> 16:40.280
"Third, big guy..."

288
16:46.030 --> 16:47.520
So you're just like a big brother to me?

289
16:48.140 --> 16:49.010
No...

290
16:53.360 --> 16:54.440
Here, sweetie. Give it a try.

291
16:54.460 --> 16:55.240
Sure thing.

292
16:56.000 --> 16:57.860
- Go on. Get the ladle now. - The ladle, alright.

293
16:57.880 --> 16:59.020
Grab some noodles.

294
16:59.040 --> 17:00.300
Do the one with the glove, son.

295
17:00.320 --> 17:00.940
There...

296
17:00.960 --> 17:01.960
Not too much, not too much.

297
17:02.040 --> 17:03.320
- About this much? - Whoa, that's a lot.

298
17:03.340 --> 17:04.980
Good. Let's say they ordered extra noodles.

299
17:05.000 --> 17:05.640
Alright, alright.

300
17:05.660 --> 17:06.430
There you go.

301
17:06.450 --> 17:07.920
- Blanch the noodles, go on. - That's like, extra-extra.

302
17:08.089 --> 17:09.970
- Scoop it in... Alright, in it goes. - Right.

303
17:09.990 --> 17:11.240
- This one first? - Yes.

304
17:11.450 --> 17:12.069
I think it's done.

305
17:12.089 --> 17:12.380
Eek!

306
17:12.400 --> 17:13.180
- Whoa! What the hell?! - Whoa!

307
17:13.200 --> 17:14.160
I think it looks done.

308
17:16.040 --> 17:17.760
What, Dad? That was so loud.

309
17:42.080 --> 17:44.340
[Baan Tiew Shop]

310
17:48.990 --> 17:49.940
Dad, Mom,

311
17:49.960 --> 17:51.590
anything else I could help you with?

312
17:51.610 --> 17:52.570
Nothing else, sweetie.

313
17:55.260 --> 17:56.260
Then...

314
17:56.470 --> 17:57.880
we're heading back.

315
17:58.070 --> 17:58.740
What?

316
17:59.220 --> 18:00.720
Aren't you gonna spend the night?

317
18:04.400 --> 18:05.200
Well...

318
18:05.490 --> 18:06.360
what about Third?

319
18:06.570 --> 18:08.250
What? He can stay in your room?

320
18:11.320 --> 18:11.920
What's wrong?

321
18:14.130 --> 18:15.440
Is that a good idea?

322
18:17.380 --> 18:18.130
Oh!

323
18:18.300 --> 18:19.120
Right...

324
18:19.550 --> 18:20.550
Then...

325
18:21.470 --> 18:23.060
we're heading home now.

326
18:23.080 --> 18:24.320
I'll visit often.

327
18:24.340 --> 18:25.360
Okay.

328
18:25.380 --> 18:26.260
Alright.

329
18:29.460 --> 18:30.950
- See you. - Mm.

330
18:30.970 --> 18:32.000
Oh, jeez...

331
18:32.020 --> 18:33.360
Can't have you feel left out.

332
18:34.350 --> 18:35.360
Take care of yourself, son.

333
18:35.380 --> 18:36.160
Alright.

334
18:37.480 --> 18:38.480
And who's driving?

335
18:38.860 --> 18:39.660
I am.

336
18:40.560 --> 18:41.790
Don't speed.

337
18:41.810 --> 18:42.460
Of course not.

338
18:42.830 --> 18:44.110
Alrighty, safe travels, sweeties.

339
18:44.130 --> 18:45.060
- Alright. - Alright.

340
18:45.080 --> 18:45.540
Goodbye.

341
18:45.560 --> 18:46.600
- Dad, Mom, goodbye. - Bye, kids.

342
18:47.910 --> 18:48.680
We'll be waiting.

343
18:51.740 --> 18:53.740
Why did you bring me here?

344
18:55.160 --> 18:57.160
I just wanna sit down and talk to you.

345
18:58.210 --> 18:59.600
Can't we do it in the car?

346
19:00.390 --> 19:02.170
That wouldn't be romantic, though.

347
19:03.480 --> 19:04.070
Come on.

348
19:05.510 --> 19:06.000
Quick!

349
19:24.270 --> 19:28.360
♫The closer we are, the clearer♫

350
19:28.380 --> 19:32.210
♫What they call love is such a wonder♫

351
19:32.580 --> 19:38.470
♫You change my world every time we meet♫

352
19:40.370 --> 19:44.450
♫I think you've gotten me hooked so well♫

353
19:44.470 --> 19:48.710
♫My heart is under your spell♫

354
19:48.730 --> 19:52.680
♫Everything I'm feeling profoundly,♫

355
19:52.700 --> 19:57.070
♫You make it special just by being next to me♫

356
19:57.090 --> 20:01.350
♫I think you've gotten me hooked so well♫

357
20:01.370 --> 20:05.600
♫Love's right in front of me, I can tell♫

358
20:05.630 --> 20:09.720
♫You're too heavenly to be my special someone♫

359
20:09.740 --> 20:12.420
♫Would you care to spell it out♫

360
20:12.440 --> 20:16.020
♫If I can call you my love at once?♫

361
20:19.390 --> 20:20.240
Hey.

362
20:21.490 --> 20:23.470
When you were a fan, why did you have to...

363
20:23.680 --> 20:25.770
wear a cap and a mask?

364
20:26.250 --> 20:27.280
What?

365
20:27.990 --> 20:29.770
I was a photographer for hire.

366
20:30.260 --> 20:32.380
If someone recognized me as a fan,

367
20:32.400 --> 20:33.760
they wouldn't be okay with it, right?

368
20:33.910 --> 20:36.080
No one wants fans working there.

369
20:37.350 --> 20:39.120
But fans need to make a living, too, right?

370
20:45.280 --> 20:46.780
No one's gonna think the way you do.

371
20:53.670 --> 20:55.160
Then, let me ask you another question.

372
20:55.980 --> 20:57.570
What do you think about Nine right now?

373
21:02.930 --> 21:03.950
Right now?

374
21:07.890 --> 21:09.170
All I know is...

375
21:10.350 --> 21:11.800
no matter what happens,

376
21:13.040 --> 21:14.560
life's gotta go on.

377
21:15.790 --> 21:17.480
Sometimes, I can't help but wonder

378
21:18.480 --> 21:20.120
if I would've been happier

379
21:20.960 --> 21:22.920
had I never met Nine.

380
21:29.380 --> 21:30.760
Come to think of it...

381
21:31.690 --> 21:32.680
I don't know...

382
21:37.890 --> 21:39.720
He was the one who created me.

383
21:41.290 --> 21:42.210
So, what now?

384
21:42.900 --> 21:44.280
Are you gonna thank him?

385
21:45.820 --> 21:47.080
Don't you think the same way I do?

386
21:51.400 --> 21:53.160
What you're saying is not wrong.

387
21:55.100 --> 21:56.360
We're on the same page.

388
22:05.080 --> 22:06.080
Then...

389
22:06.420 --> 22:07.480
let me ask you a question.

390
22:10.170 --> 22:12.180
Why did you agree to become Nine's partner?

391
22:14.470 --> 22:16.320
Nine, you made the cut for 'The Bet Love's.'

392
22:16.720 --> 22:17.980
You're not...

393
22:18.170 --> 22:20.520
getting my hopes up, right, Pitch?

394
22:21.120 --> 22:21.760
Not at all...

395
22:22.250 --> 22:23.700
The main leads are TheeJuno,

396
22:23.720 --> 22:25.000
and you're the secondary couple.

397
22:25.900 --> 22:27.020
In a bit...

398
22:27.620 --> 22:28.880
the person who stars opposite you will be here.

399
22:29.750 --> 22:30.380
Uh...

400
22:30.400 --> 22:31.640
Like, right now?

401
22:33.180 --> 22:34.060
There he is.

402
22:34.080 --> 22:35.000
Come on in!

403
22:43.780 --> 22:44.480
Third...

404
22:44.500 --> 22:46.080
Oh, you two know each other?

405
22:51.970 --> 22:53.360
I'm not working with him.

406
22:56.140 --> 22:57.280
That won't be possible, Third.

407
22:57.300 --> 22:58.840
I'm not playing opposite him, no matter what.

408
22:59.860 --> 23:01.520
I'm not asking for your opinion.

409
23:02.290 --> 23:02.720
Besides,

410
23:02.740 --> 23:04.520
I've talked to your mom and decided that

411
23:04.540 --> 23:06.760
you're playing the secondary couple.

412
23:12.390 --> 23:13.280
Crystal?

413
23:16.970 --> 23:18.180
We meet again, bud.

414
23:19.110 --> 23:20.280
Please take care of me.

415
23:23.360 --> 23:23.900
How come you always do it

416
23:23.920 --> 23:25.840
without even asking me?

417
23:26.350 --> 23:27.920
Why do I have to?

418
23:28.580 --> 23:29.970
What I believe is good for you

419
23:30.290 --> 23:31.680
will be good for you.

420
23:32.350 --> 23:33.980
Don't you wanna be an actor?

421
23:34.700 --> 23:36.840
It's true that I want to, Mom.

422
23:37.150 --> 23:37.620
But that doesn't mean

423
23:37.640 --> 23:39.480
I can play opposite just anyone.

424
23:41.500 --> 23:43.080
That mindset

425
23:43.760 --> 23:45.120
is why you've never become famous.

426
23:47.100 --> 23:48.880
If you don't see my worth,

427
23:49.990 --> 23:51.520
could you at least not look down on me?

428
23:52.640 --> 23:54.200
Then, I was right

429
23:54.690 --> 23:56.560
to push for you to play opposite Nine.

430
24:01.390 --> 24:02.260
It would've been nice

431
24:02.280 --> 24:04.400
if I were strong enough to choose my own path.

432
24:07.610 --> 24:09.000
But you do know that...

433
24:09.660 --> 24:11.260
the reason she did it

434
24:11.280 --> 24:12.380
was that she was worried about you?

435
25:23.640 --> 25:25.100
Thank you so much for today.

436
25:25.120 --> 25:26.440
I'm so happy.

437
25:27.070 --> 25:28.370
Thank you, too.

438
25:29.460 --> 25:30.140
For?

439
25:31.880 --> 25:33.720
Well, I've never made noodle soup before,

440
25:34.180 --> 25:35.840
nor have I ever been a vendor.

441
25:36.670 --> 25:38.760
Your parents were so kind to teach me.

442
25:39.380 --> 25:40.520
This is so new.

443
25:40.700 --> 25:41.750
It wasn't hard, was it?

444
25:41.770 --> 25:43.160
Just blanching the noodles,

445
25:43.290 --> 25:44.680
not making them from scratch.

446
25:47.190 --> 25:49.080
But I like that we hung out today.

447
25:52.400 --> 25:53.520
I do, too.

448
25:55.360 --> 25:56.560
Then...

449
25:59.020 --> 26:01.040
Can I come over to your room for roti sai mai?

450
26:04.510 --> 26:05.280
No.

451
26:18.160 --> 26:19.360
Am I doing a good job?

452
26:20.900 --> 26:22.400
It's covered in grime from your hands.

453
26:22.460 --> 26:23.320
Have you washed them?

454
26:23.760 --> 26:25.280
I have!

455
26:27.260 --> 26:28.880
Or do you want me to feed you with my mouth?

456
26:32.420 --> 26:33.640
Cut it...

457
26:38.600 --> 26:39.400
Say, "Aah..."

458
26:40.440 --> 26:41.200
Aah...

459
26:42.470 --> 26:44.640
Aah...

460
26:50.030 --> 26:53.300
♫Just a gentle, gentle gaze♫

461
26:53.320 --> 26:54.580
♫On me, on me♫

462
26:54.600 --> 26:55.710
♫Keep your eyes on me♫

463
26:55.730 --> 27:00.660
♫Only a gentle gaze, left or right♫

464
27:00.680 --> 27:04.370
♫If we meet eyes for a while♫

465
27:11.490 --> 27:14.200
Just as sweet as the last time we kissed...

466
27:16.270 --> 27:17.540
Enough.

467
27:17.560 --> 27:19.040
You're moving too fast.

468
27:21.450 --> 27:22.640
Alright, I'll quit teasing you.

469
27:24.640 --> 27:25.940
Though, can I ask you one thing?

470
27:31.000 --> 27:32.960
Can I spend the night with you?

471
27:38.060 --> 27:38.880
Pretty please?

472
27:39.460 --> 27:40.300
Please?

473
27:44.750 --> 27:46.360
Let me think about it.

474
28:03.960 --> 28:06.520
[Good vibes only]

475
28:15.700 --> 28:16.540
What's so funny?

476
28:16.960 --> 28:17.920
I'm looking sharp.

477
28:22.980 --> 28:24.060
Calling yourself sharp

478
28:24.080 --> 28:26.200
while bursting the seams of my clothes, Mr. Third?

479
28:26.230 --> 28:27.330
Here, let me take some photos.

480
28:27.350 --> 28:28.440
Hey, wait.

481
28:28.700 --> 28:30.520
Do you know I charge money...

482
28:30.960 --> 28:32.260
for taking photos with me?

483
28:32.420 --> 28:33.400
No more photos, then.

484
28:33.430 --> 28:34.400
Aw, no...

485
28:35.280 --> 28:36.060
Let's take photos.

486
28:44.270 --> 28:47.920
It's weird that you're acting strange around me.

487
28:48.760 --> 28:50.920
You're... too lovely for your own good.

488
28:54.370 --> 28:56.560
Love me tons, then.

489
28:58.370 --> 28:59.600
Hey, hey, hey,

490
28:59.620 --> 29:00.480
now you're just being ridiculous.

491
29:02.270 --> 29:03.440
Did you hit your head?

492
29:04.430 --> 29:05.490
Why so aggressive when you blush?

493
29:07.800 --> 29:09.160
If you wanna spend the night,

494
29:09.320 --> 29:10.560
I have some conditions.

495
29:11.780 --> 29:13.280
Don't get close to me.

496
29:13.780 --> 29:15.000
Don't touch me.

497
29:19.350 --> 29:20.320
You're seriously saying all that

498
29:20.340 --> 29:21.880
after I already kissed you?

499
29:24.020 --> 29:24.880
Whatever.

500
29:25.870 --> 29:26.720
Don't...

501
29:27.350 --> 29:28.520
touch me!

502
29:33.280 --> 29:33.960
Wan.

503
29:34.200 --> 29:34.800
Hm?

504
29:35.870 --> 29:36.640
What?

505
29:40.300 --> 29:41.500
Do you trust your man, Wan?

506
29:43.350 --> 29:45.280
No, no.

507
29:45.490 --> 29:47.280
Don't call yourself my man.

508
29:47.640 --> 29:49.360
No, no, no, that's cheesy!

509
29:49.900 --> 29:50.960
Answer me first.

510
29:51.870 --> 29:53.080
Do you trust your man, Wan?

511
29:56.480 --> 29:58.560
Of course, your boy trusts you.

512
30:00.760 --> 30:01.720
You know?

513
30:02.660 --> 30:04.440
Back at the audition,

514
30:04.590 --> 30:06.120
when you helped me out in the restroom,

515
30:06.640 --> 30:08.400
I still remember how it felt.

516
30:09.180 --> 30:10.200
If you want it to go away,

517
30:10.220 --> 30:11.120
listen to me.

518
30:12.230 --> 30:12.840
One...

519
30:13.620 --> 30:14.440
Two...

520
30:14.880 --> 30:15.800
Three...

521
30:16.180 --> 30:16.720
Four...

522
30:19.080 --> 30:19.960
How did you feel?

523
30:21.040 --> 30:22.060
Just like I feel now.

524
30:23.960 --> 30:25.560
At ease,

525
30:26.180 --> 30:27.440
trusting you,

526
30:27.460 --> 30:28.560
warm at heart,

527
30:31.550 --> 30:33.160
and you really calmed me down.

528
30:35.740 --> 30:38.000
Even though there's so much going on right now.

529
30:41.900 --> 30:43.100
You like being with me, huh?

530
30:46.890 --> 30:48.160
I think so.

531
30:50.120 --> 30:51.520
I'm so into you.

532
30:54.390 --> 30:55.620
I'm so freaking into you.

533
31:01.770 --> 31:02.760
So you shy away when you blush?

534
31:03.060 --> 31:03.580
Hm?

535
31:05.100 --> 31:06.600
Go to bed!

536
31:19.430 --> 31:21.680
There... I said go to bed.

537
31:39.560 --> 31:40.600
Go to sleep!

538
31:41.610 --> 31:42.430
Alright.

539
33:44.680 --> 33:45.480
Hey!

540
33:50.840 --> 33:52.280
Don't tell me that...

541
33:52.680 --> 33:53.800
you guys...

542
33:56.220 --> 33:56.720
What?

543
33:56.740 --> 33:57.800
Nothing happened!

544
33:58.010 --> 34:00.040
Liar. You two were about to kiss.

545
34:00.390 --> 34:01.120
Or did you...

546
34:01.560 --> 34:02.320
already kiss?

547
34:08.870 --> 34:09.719
Kiss?

548
34:09.739 --> 34:10.840
Quit having your head in the clouds!

549
34:11.030 --> 34:13.360
Even boulders can't stop shippers.

550
34:13.630 --> 34:14.989
You can't hide that you're into each other.

551
34:15.010 --> 34:16.480
Would you stop shipping?!

552
34:16.500 --> 34:17.480
This is not shipping.

553
34:17.500 --> 34:20.000
We don't ship real couples!

554
34:21.580 --> 34:22.530
Get out.

555
34:22.550 --> 34:23.320
Go!

556
34:24.199 --> 34:25.340
- Jeez... - Now.

557
34:25.360 --> 34:26.360
Fine, I will.

558
34:26.380 --> 34:28.389
You got it, boss. Let's go full send, chat.

559
34:33.920 --> 34:35.389
Are they gonna be doomed?

560
34:38.449 --> 34:39.780
This is giving me a headache.

561
34:39.810 --> 34:41.040
What, you have a headache?

562
34:42.389 --> 34:43.199
Ugh...

563
34:44.480 --> 34:45.679
What do I do?

564
35:17.710 --> 35:18.680
Hello, you?

565
35:19.640 --> 35:21.320
I'm already back at my place.

566
35:21.610 --> 35:23.240
Are you calling just to tell me that?

567
35:24.250 --> 35:26.320
And have you gone out to eat?

568
35:26.730 --> 35:27.720
I'm out,

569
35:28.100 --> 35:29.940
but I'm at the company.

570
35:29.960 --> 35:31.180
Wut asked for me.

571
35:32.110 --> 35:33.200
Have you arrived?

572
35:33.290 --> 35:34.920
I have...

573
35:35.380 --> 35:35.900
Look...

574
35:35.920 --> 35:38.040
You kicked me out so soon today.

575
35:38.070 --> 35:39.600
I could've dropped you off.

576
35:42.180 --> 35:43.450
Ooh...

577
35:45.050 --> 35:47.440
Hey, I have to go. Cher's here...

578
35:54.660 --> 35:55.520
Who was that?

579
35:58.370 --> 35:59.640
That was my dad.

580
35:59.800 --> 36:01.320
Should we go inside now?

581
36:04.500 --> 36:05.280
Your dad?

582
36:05.580 --> 36:06.100
Why did you grin so widely

583
36:06.120 --> 36:07.520
while talking to your dad?

584
36:08.060 --> 36:09.480
Uh...

585
36:09.700 --> 36:11.140
My dad cracked some jokes.

586
36:11.160 --> 36:12.190
He said...

587
36:12.210 --> 36:13.570
he blanched the noodles Spider-Man style.

588
36:13.590 --> 36:15.270
Pew, pew, pew, pew!

589
36:15.290 --> 36:16.280
Pew...

590
36:16.440 --> 36:17.560
I wanna meet him.

591
36:17.970 --> 36:19.240
He must be so funny

592
36:19.590 --> 36:21.040
since you grinned so widely.

593
36:22.130 --> 36:23.330
- Right. - Go on in first.

594
36:23.350 --> 36:24.400
I'll go grab some coffee.

595
36:43.520 --> 36:46.400
[Can we meet up if you have time?]

596
36:49.840 --> 36:52.010
[Can we meet up if you have time?

597
36:52.030 --> 36:54.200
I wanna tell you how sorry I am for everything]

598
37:00.080 --> 37:02.040
Renji and Wan...

599
37:03.930 --> 37:06.380
you're both tapped as Friends of 'MD'

600
37:06.400 --> 37:08.880
for its upcoming Spin Time model!

601
37:10.580 --> 37:11.200
Flabbergasted?

602
37:11.400 --> 37:12.880
Completely shocked and flabbergasted?

603
37:12.900 --> 37:14.020
Thank Wut!

604
37:14.040 --> 37:15.020
Go on, thank him.

605
37:15.040 --> 37:16.200
- Thank you. - Thank you.

606
37:16.540 --> 37:17.720
Bless your heart, dear.

607
37:18.420 --> 37:19.400
Ugh...

608
37:19.590 --> 37:21.270
After many attempts, at that.

609
37:21.290 --> 37:22.750
I fought tooth and nail for it!

610
37:22.770 --> 37:24.560
But we did it!

611
37:24.940 --> 37:26.760
Is MD the watch brand

612
37:26.780 --> 37:28.080
that's been going viral lately?

613
37:28.260 --> 37:29.280
Precisely.

614
37:29.360 --> 37:29.920
Ooh!

615
37:29.940 --> 37:31.860
All campaigns launched in Thailand

616
37:31.880 --> 37:34.200
for one whole year,

617
37:34.220 --> 37:36.720
you're on board for those!

618
37:37.280 --> 37:38.320
- Wow... - Wow...

619
37:43.400 --> 37:46.240
And you have to work with ThirdNine for MD.

620
37:47.880 --> 37:49.400
Brace yourself

621
37:49.980 --> 37:51.680
and be careful.

622
37:53.020 --> 37:53.800
It'll be fine.

623
37:54.590 --> 37:56.760
If you guys have to meet, I'll step up.

624
37:57.070 --> 37:58.400
Avoid them if you can.

625
37:58.920 --> 38:00.320
Just see them when you need to, yeah?

626
38:01.900 --> 38:02.450
Uh, but, like...

627
38:02.470 --> 38:03.400
So...

628
38:04.030 --> 38:06.480
What are they gonna do next?

629
38:07.280 --> 38:07.930
I mean...

630
38:09.020 --> 38:10.760
are they plotting something?

631
38:13.370 --> 38:15.040
Come to think of it,

632
38:15.780 --> 38:19.400
I'm sure they have the receipt.

633
38:20.400 --> 38:21.540
But I can't wrap my head around

634
38:21.560 --> 38:22.600
why they're not leaking it.

635
38:22.820 --> 38:24.080
But I know...

636
38:26.510 --> 38:28.160
why they're not leaking it.

637
38:29.090 --> 38:29.840
Hm?

638
38:35.820 --> 38:36.520
Oh...

639
38:37.290 --> 38:38.840
I just wanted to say something.

640
38:38.860 --> 38:39.800
It just looked so cool.

641
38:40.110 --> 38:40.980
Ugh...

642
38:42.350 --> 38:43.620
I just wish I could take on the role

643
38:43.640 --> 38:46.120
of Wan's knight in shining armor.

644
38:48.370 --> 38:49.040
I'm sorry.

645
38:49.170 --> 38:49.760
There...

646
38:49.900 --> 38:50.920
There's your shining armor

647
38:50.940 --> 38:52.080
awaiting you.

648
38:52.160 --> 38:53.560
Put it on and set out.

649
38:53.810 --> 38:55.040
There, take Cher with you.

650
38:56.080 --> 38:57.330
- Come on. - What nonsense...

651
38:57.350 --> 38:58.930
I'll have a word with Wan.

652
38:58.950 --> 39:00.040
Take your coffee, too.

653
39:00.060 --> 39:01.460
Oh... I already finished it.

654
39:01.480 --> 39:02.960
Please throw it away for me. Thanks.

655
39:05.240 --> 39:06.900
- I'll be waiting downstairs. - Fabulous!

656
39:06.920 --> 39:07.920
There...

657
39:07.940 --> 39:09.000
It's okay, Wut.

658
39:09.030 --> 39:09.780
I'll... I'll...

659
39:09.800 --> 39:11.420
Look at that damn boy.

660
39:11.440 --> 39:13.000
I raised him and shaped him myself.

661
39:14.390 --> 39:15.680
Don't you follow in his footsteps.

662
39:16.160 --> 39:16.800
Alright.

663
39:18.670 --> 39:19.520
Listen, Wan.

664
39:21.160 --> 39:22.560
I have something important to discuss.

665
39:24.820 --> 39:25.860
You cannot

666
39:26.220 --> 39:28.600
make any mistakes on this project.

667
39:30.280 --> 39:32.560
Whoever has shown themselves to be your enemy,

668
39:32.580 --> 39:34.300
keep a close eye on them.

669
39:34.320 --> 39:35.800
Do not let them out of your sight.

670
39:36.180 --> 39:37.080
Understood?

671
39:40.020 --> 39:41.120
Of course, Wut.

672
39:45.380 --> 39:46.470
This one's okay.

673
39:48.170 --> 39:48.880
I think that'll work.

674
39:49.060 --> 39:49.840
Thank you.

675
39:50.510 --> 39:51.200
Wan.

676
39:52.880 --> 39:54.200
Renji already headed back.

677
39:54.580 --> 39:55.820
What did Wut say?

678
39:57.600 --> 39:59.920
He just repeated that I couldn't make mistakes.

679
40:01.140 --> 40:01.860
Mm.

680
40:03.110 --> 40:04.760
And don't forget to film a perfume review

681
40:04.780 --> 40:05.640
for the client.

682
40:05.940 --> 40:06.760
They've chased us up about it.

683
40:07.110 --> 40:07.660
Sure thing.

684
40:07.680 --> 40:09.760
I'll get to it as soon as I get back to my place.

685
40:11.000 --> 40:12.440
There's one thing to keep in mind

686
40:13.130 --> 40:14.070
about Nine.

687
40:14.770 --> 40:16.070
If you see each other again,

688
40:16.990 --> 40:18.780
keep yourself out of trouble.

689
40:19.320 --> 40:20.820
Avoid him at all costs if you can.

690
40:23.630 --> 40:24.900
I'm gonna go talk to Wut.

691
40:25.140 --> 40:26.360
Tell me whenever you get home.

692
40:29.090 --> 40:29.680
Alright.

693
40:29.860 --> 40:30.420
Mm.

694
40:37.710 --> 40:40.000
Wan, why do you look so stressed out?

695
40:41.910 --> 40:42.720
Wan?

696
40:48.360 --> 40:49.880
How did your work meeting go?

697
40:53.440 --> 40:54.980
Mm... actually,

698
40:56.340 --> 40:57.890
I got to sign with MD.

699
40:58.520 --> 40:59.600
Whoa, seriously?

700
41:02.010 --> 41:04.440
Congrats.

701
41:04.700 --> 41:05.720
You did such a good job.

702
41:06.090 --> 41:08.060
That means I'll get to work with you again,

703
41:08.080 --> 41:08.860
Mr. Third.

704
41:12.230 --> 41:13.280
Yes...

705
41:13.880 --> 41:15.120
Nothing but good things.

706
41:15.790 --> 41:18.020
So why did you look so stressed out, Mr. Wan?

707
41:18.040 --> 41:18.640
Hm?

708
41:20.300 --> 41:21.240
It was nothing.

709
41:22.100 --> 41:24.000
Can you drive faster?

710
41:24.810 --> 41:25.520
It's just...

711
41:25.900 --> 41:27.600
I have to film a gig for Cher

712
41:27.620 --> 41:28.760
'cause I forgot.

713
41:29.300 --> 41:31.000
Jeez, I thought something was on your mind.

714
41:33.000 --> 41:34.440
You just forgot to film a gig.

715
41:34.520 --> 41:35.560
I can definitely help.

716
41:36.540 --> 41:38.160
I'll film you nicely.

717
41:38.470 --> 41:39.560
How does that sound?

718
41:42.240 --> 41:43.040
Good boy.

719
42:02.490 --> 42:03.970
Tell me about your day.

720
42:03.990 --> 42:04.690
Hm?

721
42:05.390 --> 42:06.960
Tell me about your day.

722
42:08.360 --> 42:09.360
Well...

723
42:10.100 --> 42:12.420
I signed a contract with MD Watch.

724
42:13.690 --> 42:14.980
Wan was adorable

725
42:15.000 --> 42:17.120
when he found out we'd get to sign.

726
42:17.310 --> 42:19.400
As for Nine, he's been quiet.

727
42:20.170 --> 42:21.800
Guess he knows about the video from North.

728
42:22.100 --> 42:24.600
This is what it's like to have the upper hand.

729
42:26.690 --> 42:28.200
Nine's playing second fiddle.

730
42:28.890 --> 42:29.520
Mm.

731
42:30.210 --> 42:31.280
The plot has thickened.

732
42:32.590 --> 42:34.540
Wan seems so much more relieved.

733
42:34.980 --> 42:37.500
Helping him, I felt like a leading man.

734
42:49.210 --> 42:50.680
You wanna be Wan's leading man?

735
42:56.860 --> 42:57.760
I don't.

736
42:58.810 --> 43:02.620
I wanna be yours alone, babe.

737
43:13.210 --> 43:13.960
Sulking?

738
43:16.020 --> 43:17.400
You're acting like a dog.

739
43:25.380 --> 43:26.600
Wan's dog, huh?

740
43:30.330 --> 43:31.640
Nope, yours, babe.

741
43:31.990 --> 43:32.760
Who's your babe?

742
43:33.090 --> 43:34.080
You're my babe, Time.

743
43:34.710 --> 43:35.560
I'll let it slide...

744
43:46.870 --> 43:47.820
So where is View?

745
43:48.530 --> 43:49.660
Prepping for the exam at her friend's.

746
43:49.680 --> 43:50.580
She'll be back tomorrow.

747
44:03.400 --> 44:03.800
Alright.

748
44:03.820 --> 44:04.600
Okay, let's go.

749
44:05.400 --> 44:06.100
Okay...

750
44:06.600 --> 44:07.740
- Ready? - Mm.

751
44:07.760 --> 44:08.660
Three...

752
44:09.010 --> 44:09.880
Two...

753
44:10.660 --> 44:11.440
Action.

754
44:21.510 --> 44:22.840
Hanky House's perfume

755
44:22.860 --> 44:24.630
in Unwritten Letter,

756
44:24.650 --> 44:27.020
clean-scented, pleasant, and for everyday use.

757
44:27.040 --> 44:29.230
You'll smell like you just showered at all times!

758
44:32.240 --> 44:33.140
Cut.

759
44:34.560 --> 44:35.360
That was cute.

760
44:37.030 --> 44:38.000
Not even a question.

761
44:48.540 --> 44:48.920
Whoa...

762
44:49.400 --> 44:50.240
What are you doing?

763
45:00.500 --> 45:01.320
I think

764
45:01.470 --> 45:03.040
this fragrance kinda suits you.

765
45:10.630 --> 45:11.510
What's with you?

766
45:12.820 --> 45:13.720
Mm!

767
45:14.150 --> 45:15.200
What's with you?!

768
45:17.160 --> 45:18.160
Ugh!

769
45:22.480 --> 45:23.760
Am I making you blush?

770
45:26.790 --> 45:27.680
Yes.

771
45:29.720 --> 45:31.000
But... I like it.

772
45:32.140 --> 45:33.000
You can do it again.

773
45:39.830 --> 45:40.940
Ugh!

774
45:41.280 --> 45:42.600
You're being so cheeky.

775
45:43.000 --> 45:44.270
Just head back to your place now.

776
45:45.490 --> 45:46.880
How could I?

777
45:47.190 --> 45:48.960
I haven't even eaten anything.

778
45:50.580 --> 45:52.360
Are you kicking me out after I did you a favor?

779
45:54.460 --> 45:55.230
I'm...

780
45:55.600 --> 45:56.320
hungry.

781
46:06.180 --> 46:07.360
Well...

782
46:08.650 --> 46:09.680
what do you feel like?

783
46:19.770 --> 46:20.880
Whatever you make,

784
46:22.200 --> 46:23.520
I'll eat it.

785
46:35.050 --> 46:35.880
Seriously?

786
46:38.220 --> 46:39.880
This is all I have here.

787
46:40.690 --> 46:41.680
Are you eating it or not?

788
46:51.000 --> 46:52.000
Hey, wait!

789
46:53.910 --> 46:55.040
I don't do spicy...

790
46:55.510 --> 46:57.680
I'm only adding a bit in for color.

791
46:58.700 --> 47:00.120
- Mm, mm. - That's right...

792
47:00.360 --> 47:02.320
Just this much. Pick it out if you're not eating it.

793
47:06.400 --> 47:07.800
Do you like watching movies?

794
47:08.580 --> 47:09.920
Movies?

795
47:10.100 --> 47:11.360
Not really.

796
47:11.650 --> 47:12.880
I'm fine watching them, though.

797
47:13.480 --> 47:14.140
If I had to guess,

798
47:14.160 --> 47:15.880
you like watching movies, right?

799
47:17.300 --> 47:18.480
Yes, I do.

800
47:19.500 --> 47:21.040
Barely anyone was home,

801
47:22.390 --> 47:23.960
so movies kept me company.

802
47:24.790 --> 47:26.780
Your family must be so busy.

803
47:27.580 --> 47:29.100
Your mom is a politician,

804
47:29.120 --> 47:30.120
so what about your dad?

805
47:31.290 --> 47:32.120
He's a doctor.

806
47:32.990 --> 47:33.990
Wow...

807
47:34.010 --> 47:35.520
What a perfect freaking family.

808
47:45.890 --> 47:46.600
Hey?

809
47:49.990 --> 47:50.720
Then...

810
47:50.960 --> 47:52.240
wanna watch a movie tonight?

811
47:52.610 --> 47:53.640
If you want to, that is.

812
47:56.310 --> 47:56.920
I do.

813
48:03.200 --> 48:04.800
So, what movie should we watch?

814
48:05.880 --> 48:07.480
There's this one movie I really like.

815
48:08.500 --> 48:10.800
It inspired me to be who I am today.

816
48:13.880 --> 48:14.720
What is it?

817
48:17.200 --> 48:18.720
Have you ever seen 'Forrest Gump'?

818
48:19.960 --> 48:21.640
Once, I think.

819
48:23.100 --> 48:24.480
But it's been a really long time.

820
48:24.710 --> 48:25.880
I don't really recall it.

821
48:25.990 --> 48:27.440
Didn't it come out way before we were born?

822
48:28.800 --> 48:29.680
It did.

823
48:30.080 --> 48:31.800
I saw it for the first time back in 11th grade.

824
48:32.800 --> 48:34.640
I still remember how it felt.

825
48:35.570 --> 48:37.280
And I really like Tom Hanks.

826
48:38.660 --> 48:40.080
He's the best.

827
48:40.220 --> 48:41.120
No matter what role,

828
48:41.140 --> 48:42.360
he seems to become one with the character.

829
48:42.810 --> 48:44.720
Also, he's true to himself,

830
48:45.010 --> 48:46.360
never embodying anything he doesn't believe in.

831
48:48.760 --> 48:50.320
Or maybe I wanted an escape from myself?

832
48:50.580 --> 48:51.720
That's why I chose this career.

833
48:52.820 --> 48:53.840
Mm...

834
48:55.200 --> 48:56.640
Are you a Tom Hanks fanboy?

835
48:59.110 --> 49:00.040
You could say that.

836
49:00.780 --> 49:02.240
I aspire to be the kind of actor he is.

837
49:03.080 --> 49:04.720
It's like he lit a firework in my heart.

838
49:05.220 --> 49:06.980
After watching him for some time, I felt...

839
49:07.760 --> 49:09.700
I wanted to impress people with my acting,

840
49:09.720 --> 49:10.490
just like he does.

841
49:15.010 --> 49:16.560
So, since you started acting,

842
49:16.680 --> 49:17.500
has there been any coworker

843
49:17.520 --> 49:18.600
who's impressed you?

844
49:20.230 --> 49:21.920
I have to admit...

845
49:22.410 --> 49:24.200
I don't really follow foreign actors.

846
49:29.000 --> 49:31.000
Actually, I had a senior whom I deeply respected.

847
49:32.440 --> 49:33.320
Who?

848
49:35.700 --> 49:36.480
Oh?

849
49:37.480 --> 49:38.420
Something stressing you out, Third?

850
49:44.410 --> 49:45.120
What's wrong?

851
49:45.580 --> 49:47.000
Anything you wanna talk about?

852
49:47.460 --> 49:48.460
You can tell me anything.

853
49:48.480 --> 49:49.320
I won't charge.

854
49:53.960 --> 49:55.880
Just the same old fight with my family.

855
49:56.590 --> 49:57.590
It's about...

856
49:58.570 --> 50:00.240
your mom not wanting you to be an actor, right?

857
50:02.590 --> 50:04.440
I've tried to explain to her,

858
50:05.790 --> 50:07.370
but she wouldn't listen.

859
50:09.100 --> 50:10.860
She said this would be the last project.

860
50:11.590 --> 50:12.840
If I don't take off this time...

861
50:13.500 --> 50:15.080
she'll have me do something else.

862
50:18.290 --> 50:19.320
What about 'The Deep Between Us'?

863
50:21.190 --> 50:22.760
I'm here. I'll help you.

864
50:28.050 --> 50:29.490
First, stop worrying.

865
50:31.100 --> 50:32.280
I already read the script.

866
50:32.580 --> 50:33.440
A buttload of fun.

867
50:33.740 --> 50:35.080
The secondary couple's well-written.

868
50:36.690 --> 50:37.560
Honestly,

869
50:38.510 --> 50:39.800
you might become more famous than me.

870
50:47.910 --> 50:48.880
Here's the deal.

871
50:49.040 --> 50:50.600
Let's do our best.

872
50:54.050 --> 50:55.240
If something's flawed,

873
50:55.260 --> 50:56.400
we'll fix it.

874
50:57.600 --> 50:59.080
If you still dream,

875
51:00.030 --> 51:01.600
keep chasing after it.

876
51:02.100 --> 51:02.900
Are you gonna sit here

877
51:02.920 --> 51:04.000
dwelling on your own thoughts

878
51:04.620 --> 51:06.160
or give your dream another shot?

879
51:06.800 --> 51:07.840
Is he...

880
51:08.300 --> 51:09.480
Thee as in TheeJuno?

881
51:10.080 --> 51:11.360
The one who got into an accident?

882
51:12.890 --> 51:14.680
Yes, that Thee.

883
51:24.060 --> 51:25.400
Actually, the main couple

884
51:26.280 --> 51:28.460
in 'The Deep Between Us' were Thee and Juno.

885
51:30.990 --> 51:32.600
He really wanted to act in this series,

886
51:33.760 --> 51:35.360
so when I had to take over,

887
51:35.680 --> 51:36.960
I worked so hard on it.

888
51:40.520 --> 51:42.400
That's why I acted like that

889
51:44.440 --> 51:45.680
when you auditioned.

890
51:50.500 --> 51:51.640
I'm sorry.

891
51:52.740 --> 51:54.520
I really had no clue.

892
51:58.810 --> 52:00.240
I had too high expectations.

893
52:01.220 --> 52:02.260
I'm sorry, too.

894
52:06.300 --> 52:08.510
It's hard for me to talk about Thee's accident.

895
52:10.880 --> 52:12.160
I've never been able to accept it.

896
52:13.600 --> 52:14.860
Sometimes, I blame myself.

897
52:17.480 --> 52:18.400
Don't blame yourself.

898
52:18.420 --> 52:20.760
Everyone's doing their best in their own way.

899
52:25.000 --> 52:27.460
[You are not alone]

900
52:27.480 --> 52:28.990
So, what's your dream?

901
52:31.900 --> 52:32.920
My dream?

902
52:35.410 --> 52:36.240
I don't know.

903
52:37.080 --> 52:39.260
All I know is, I like playing around with cameras.

904
52:41.160 --> 52:42.360
Honestly,

905
52:42.390 --> 52:44.080
I wanted to become a traveler,

906
52:44.680 --> 52:46.800
taking photos of different locations.

907
52:50.500 --> 52:52.480
I never once thought I'd end up as an actor.

908
52:54.990 --> 52:56.000
Honestly,

909
52:56.100 --> 52:57.280
it's not too late.

910
52:58.190 --> 52:59.320
Wanna try being...

911
52:59.720 --> 53:00.920
an influencer

912
53:01.200 --> 53:02.600
or a travel YouTuber?

913
53:04.190 --> 53:05.640
Consult with your company.

914
53:05.790 --> 53:07.160
They might have guidance for you.

915
53:09.200 --> 53:10.120
Sounds good.

916
53:10.640 --> 53:12.640
I'll ask Wut and see if I can.

917
53:13.990 --> 53:14.840
What about you?

918
53:15.920 --> 53:18.600
If you weren't an actor, what would you be?

919
53:26.660 --> 53:27.660
Einstein.

920
53:28.090 --> 53:28.720
Huh?

921
53:29.980 --> 53:31.440
Are you just tryna get on my nerves?

922
53:31.670 --> 53:32.480
Why?

923
53:32.690 --> 53:34.040
It'd be cool to be like him.

924
53:35.800 --> 53:37.680
So there's a nerdy side to you.

925
53:39.300 --> 53:40.760
I like science.

926
53:41.630 --> 53:43.320
I may not look like it, but I'm a chemistry nerd.

927
53:44.420 --> 53:46.360
At first, I planned to apply to the Faculty of Science.

928
53:47.280 --> 53:48.880
But I found my calling as an actor first,

929
53:49.220 --> 53:49.820
so I went with Comm Arts

930
53:49.840 --> 53:50.880
and majored in performing arts.

931
53:53.680 --> 53:54.680
Honestly,

932
53:55.800 --> 53:57.200
I couldn't have told

933
53:57.220 --> 53:59.460
you were a chemistry nerd if you hadn't told me.

934
54:00.460 --> 54:01.240
So...

935
54:01.780 --> 54:03.340
is there something else I don't know?

936
54:04.340 --> 54:06.360
There's... a lot.

937
54:07.600 --> 54:08.920
Wanna get to know me?

938
54:10.790 --> 54:12.320
Should we take turns asking questions?

939
54:13.090 --> 54:13.680
Mm.

940
54:13.700 --> 54:14.960
Then, I'll go first.

941
54:15.520 --> 54:16.660
What do you usually do

942
54:16.680 --> 54:17.770
after you get back to your place?

943
54:17.790 --> 54:18.600
I take a shower.

944
54:19.990 --> 54:20.720
That's all?

945
54:20.880 --> 54:21.680
Well, it's hot.

946
54:21.880 --> 54:24.560
Well, what else do you do after that?

947
54:24.790 --> 54:25.840
If you're that curious,

948
54:26.320 --> 54:27.480
why don't we move in together?

949
54:30.900 --> 54:31.520
No.

950
54:32.100 --> 54:32.840
No to what?

951
54:35.760 --> 54:36.760
I have no freaking clue.

952
54:37.680 --> 54:39.240
Alright, I won't tease you anymore.

953
54:39.710 --> 54:40.740
Usually, after taking a shower,

954
54:40.760 --> 54:42.600
I read and review the script.

955
54:43.640 --> 54:46.080
Some scenes feel different when you

956
54:46.430 --> 54:47.340
read them on the page

957
54:47.360 --> 54:48.400
than when you act them out.

958
54:49.970 --> 54:51.100
You're...

959
54:51.400 --> 54:52.620
such a nerd.

960
54:54.580 --> 54:57.880
Don't you ever want to take some time to relax?

961
55:03.570 --> 55:05.490
How about we start here?

962
55:06.780 --> 55:08.360
Ugh... Third!

963
55:09.010 --> 55:09.890
You're being ridiculous.

964
55:19.590 --> 55:20.280
Wan.

965
55:22.390 --> 55:22.990
Hm?

966
55:28.680 --> 55:29.720
Will you be my boyfriend?

967
55:38.990 --> 55:40.320
I truly like you.

968
55:42.500 --> 55:44.160
If you'd let me say the word "love,"

969
55:44.980 --> 55:46.400
I'd say it right now.

970
55:52.440 --> 55:53.640
You're just...

971
55:55.080 --> 55:55.940
You always say something

972
55:55.960 --> 55:58.040
that catches me off guard.

973
56:00.290 --> 56:01.740
Well, I want to finally be

974
56:01.760 --> 56:03.200
your real-life leading man.

975
56:11.080 --> 56:11.880
Delusional.

976
56:12.560 --> 56:13.400
Sorry...

977
56:14.160 --> 56:15.040
Do you like it, though?

978
56:16.890 --> 56:17.640
Well, yeah.

979
56:27.890 --> 56:29.160
Be my boyfriend, please?

980
56:35.790 --> 56:36.440
Mm...

981
56:37.480 --> 56:38.160
Alright.

982
56:40.320 --> 56:42.320
I'm your boyfriend now, Mr. Third.

983
56:50.120 --> 56:51.160
Let me ask you something.

984
56:52.120 --> 56:54.000
When did you start liking me?

985
57:07.820 --> 57:08.800
The rooftop.

986
57:23.320 --> 57:24.280
But why?

987
57:28.280 --> 57:30.240
Well... you were cute.

988
57:38.100 --> 57:39.880
So why did you call the guards on me?

989
57:41.360 --> 57:43.400
And you even chewed me out big time.

990
57:43.800 --> 57:44.400
Hm?

991
57:48.240 --> 57:49.280
Sorry.

992
57:50.900 --> 57:51.490
Here,

993
57:52.580 --> 57:53.710
I'll let you hit me.

994
57:57.320 --> 57:58.610
Ow...

995
57:58.630 --> 58:01.320
Ow, ow, ow, that hurts, that hurts.

996
